          "answer": "je doit",
          "feedback": "Je takes '{dois}', not 'doit'. Remember: je dois, il doit"
        },
        {
          "answer": "tu dois",
          "feedback": "That's 'you must', not 'I must'. Focus on the pronoun!"
        }
